  "main_theorem": "WirtingerStore.ring_spreading_le_store",
  "main_scope": "For a nonempty finite ring, any global coordinatewise heat path with zero initial sum satisfies the requested no-input breathe bound for every t >= 0. The rate is 2*(2-2*cos(2*pi/n)).",
